<title>USA: Inland Resources buys Utah properties.</title>
<headline>Inland Resources buys Utah properties.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inland Resources Inc said Monday that it has agreed to acquire all of the producing properties and related assets in the Monument Butte Field owned by Equitable Resources Energy Co, a subsidiary of Equitable Resources Inc for $53 million.</p>
<p>The Monument Butte Field is located in the Uinta Basin of northeastern Utah.</p>
<p>Closing is scheduled for September 30, 1997.</p>
<p>These properties are contiguous to the company's properties and to the production assets of Enserch Exploration Inc presently under a contract for purchase by the company, as previously anounced.</p>
</text>
